      "uid": "zhcn:50ebe2a28296b9a388cdce1f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你喜欢就好，这是我的荣幸！\n因为我最喜欢在这里睡午觉了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5a0f66d4fa036fe5a6e4ba93db3673c0bb14cc305afa1a39d2b7fc72e696f7a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
