      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "根据过去留下的纪录──\n她非常喜欢在重要的人守望下，\n尽情地在这片无尽的草原上奔驰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c6c14f2d29812e6204727c0d4e90838a4dc5c0ada3424ad513fd0ad5474747f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
